WEBVTT

00:31:57.490 --> 00:32:02.855
And that kind of tenacity
just doesn't exist in the US.

00:32:03.244 --> 00:32:06.085
And that's the end advantage
for the Chinese entrepreneurs.

00:32:06.109 --> 00:32:10.388
CA: Is part of it, Kai-Fu,
that many of entrepreneurs grew up poor,

00:32:10.412 --> 00:32:12.085
they literally grew up hungry

00:32:12.109 --> 00:32:16.559
and so the motivation
is more deeply grounded

00:32:16.583 --> 00:32:18.281
than their competitors int he West.

00:32:18.305 --> 00:32:23.742
KFL: If you can imagine someone growing up
who might be 30 or 40,

00:32:23.766 --> 00:32:27.447
the family has been poor
for 20 generations.

00:32:27.888 --> 00:32:32.808
And it was only when Deng Xiaoping
said let some people get rich first,